    "route": "Muziek en maatschappij depth package",
    "selectionRule": "official-order-tiebreak",
    "basis": "The generic Musicology target requires one of two 30-EC depth packages and one of two 7.5-EC context courses to instantiate the full major. Music and Society and Art, Culture and Society are each listed first in the adopted 2026-27 EER, so they are selected as neutral official-order tie-breaks. The 60-EC profiling space remains generic because the regulations deliberately leave its approved subject matter to the student. These judgments were fixed before UCR course fit was considered."
